,"relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:146206","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"株式会社エモ","creatorId":"vndb:s26674","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26674","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26674","name":"株式会社エモ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:146207","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c75167","characterName":"草壁 愛子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c75167"},"originalCharacterName":"草壁 愛子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's the protagonist's neighbour in the apartment building and the mother of his childhood friend, Hiroki Kusakabe. She's 38 years old. She was his first love, and the one he still loves to this day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she appears gentle, soft-spoken, and easygoing, she's just as strong-willed as Ryoko, having raised her only son, Hiroki, without a single tear."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Until a few years ago, she worked tirelessly alongside the men at a listed company. But thanks to her husband's insurance money, compensation for an accident, and her tireless work at the company, she'd managed to save enough to have a hassle-free wedding after her son went to college...and then she quit."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryoko, who was considering hiring more staff due to her busy schedule, offered her work at Miyato Coffee. Now, as the beautiful manager and beautiful waitress of Miyato Coffee, \"Ryoko-chan and Aiko-chan,\" she's the centre of attention for older men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like Ryoko, Aiko is teased by young men and even older men in the neighbourhood, but"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"she brushes it off by saying, \"Until Hiroki settles down...\" In reality, she's worried about her son, who is a playboy and whose relationships with his girlfriends aren't lasting, but at the same time, she's optimistic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Like Ryoko, Aiko is also tormented by her sexual desire, which grows stronger with each passing year. Lately, when she watches Makoto or Hiroki from behind while they're working their part-time jobs, she finds herself excited by the feeling of a young, masculine presence in their backs and shoulders."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"And on nights when her female self is throbbing, she fills the holes in her body and heart with the adult toys that seem to increase every month, greedily consuming pleasure while groaning like an animal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75167"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf33068d10583285058f1d1ebf73c694197130e21a9673716fc41dd5f2f3b826.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/91ae7c8a3505e5afacd792a0764297b3225b7138a8e899e11da397a18a93b8d6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"葵 時緒","creatorId":"vndb:s1658","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1658","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1658","name":"葵時緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76771","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c75168","characterName":"宮藤 涼子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c75168"},"originalCharacterName":"宮藤 涼子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"38"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's 38 years old. She's the beautiful owner of Miyato Coffee, a small but thriving coffee shop at the entrance to the shopping district. Even after losing the protagonist's father, she never showed any signs of weakness, always smiling. She's a wonderful woman who raised the protagonist single-handedly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His mother may no longer be a shadow of her former self, but according to a regular customer, she was once the leader of a group of reigning dark-skinned gal ladies from the late 20th century who dominated the men around her with fear, violence, and beauty. Now, with her ripe body and charming smile, she's the shopping district's idol, attracting or disappointing the gazes of single and married men alike."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's constantly asked out on dates by unpopular college entrance exam repeaters, middle-aged men selling their free time, and increasingly thriving old men, but she mercilessly dismisses them with a \"sorry, I'm just a look-alike!\" Thanks to her, the coffee shop is thriving. It's not like it's all men, and older women hang out as well, busy complaining about their husbands."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryoko refuses whenever a customer throws powder at her, either jokingly or quite seriously. To be honest, half of it is because she's faithful to her late husband. The other half seems to be because she can't think about such things until her son becomes a real man. ...But recently, she's been feeling confused by her sexual desire, which isn't getting weaker as she gets older, but is getting stronger."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In particular, when she smells the sweat of young men like Masako or Hiroki after they come home from school on a gym class day, her womanhood starts to ache intensely. And, unable to leave this agonising, feverish desire that seems to violate her entire body from the core, the number of nights she indulges in masturbation is increasing day by day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"A woman is indeed meant to burn until she's turned to ashes\", Ryoko thinks. Looking at her fingers, wet and gleaming with her own nectar, Ryoko once again makes fun of herself tonight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75168"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7ef317045a416e1829afdaa5c7113d4110eb3b3e7f8d37a566cef4e4f1722ba1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f714c1b89a00588df04ff9227739beb190fcf46b17140cb544f66ba60fd405d8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"御苑生 メイ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76770","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c75169","characterName":"草壁 広樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c75169"},"originalCharacterName":"草壁 広樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a young man who lives next door to the protagonist's house and is a childhood friend. He's not particularly handsome, but he has a charming face, is easygoing, and isn't easily intimidated. He's a vulgar, cheerful, and open pervert. He tends to be disliked by serious girls, but he's popular with the type who enjoy casual romances only among students, and he's been on and off with a lot of girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a playboy, but not a sleazy one. He only dates girls who are willing to just hang out with him, with no strings attached. Of course, he's careful not to let his mother or Ryoko, the woman he admires, find out about his relationships with girls like that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In fact, since he was a child, he has had feelings for Ryoko, the mother of Makoto, who often looked after him in place of his mother. He genuinely likes her, and he wants to violate Ryoko, who seems to be getting more and more erotic with each passing day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c75169"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf712389559cb108f7cfe494f9d0d2b88a346c95a862181c94fa02d9d23349a6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d7836546e747013d5a44775b58f0a89b91d5cad31291fe65d3dfbe54deafe78.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c92630","characterName":"宮藤 真心","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c92630"},"originalCharacterName":"宮藤 真心","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1873","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2884","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1873","name":"ORCSOFT","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:27041:2884","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15756","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15756","name":"SVN","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:130053:v22448","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1873","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1873","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1873","name":"ORCSOFT","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:139110:v22448","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p5679","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p5679","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p5679